Package: rpbnb
Type: Package
Title: Bivariate and Random-Parameter Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Project", "Author", email = "wonstran@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maximum-likelihood estimation of the Famoye/Sarmanov bivariate
    negative binomial (NB2) regression model and maximum-simulated-likelihood
    estimation of a bivariate random-parameter negative binomial model, with a
    normal random-coefficient data simulator, diagnostics, and standard model
    methods.
